abstract: "Zero-dependency JavaScript/ESM calculation engine and open 2026 reference datasets (JSON/CSV) for German/DACH firewood unit conversions (RM/SRM/FM, TFZ/FNR), oil tank dipstick geometry (DIN 6608 horizontal cylinders, PE battery tanks, and spherical tanks), and four-fuel heating cost comparisons including the 2026 BEHG CO2 price."
